#
# Conformance case: contracts/paraconsistent-counterfactual-revision-unsupported
# AC: a ReasoningContract that pairs a paraconsistent
# (gap/glut-admitting) admissible valuation (logic:AdmitAllFour) with
# counterfactual entrenchment revision (logic:EntrenchmentRevision) is a
# FORBIDDEN facet combination (RuleNoParaconsistentCounterfactualRevision): the
# closest-world selection that generates the counterfactual states is not defined
# over gappy or glutty valuations. The compile MUST emit an UNSUPPORTED_CONTRACT
# Severity::Error and the harness MUST short-circuit before evaluating — the
# "unsupported is a hard stop" guarantee, pinned at the corpus level (profile.json
# declares "expect_unsupported": true).

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/contracts/paraconsistent-counterfactual-revision/> .

ex:UnsupportedContract a logic:ReasoningContract ;
    logic:admissibleValuation logic:AdmitAllFour ;
    logic:revision logic:EntrenchmentRevision .
